paque básico con el uso de bolsas courier. Puedes personalizar como quieras tu packaging.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-68ac" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-hAcGzb jHOovW pf-279_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-eGPXGI cIlovf"><div class="sc-iCfMLu eehqFj pf-280_ pf-r pf-c-cm" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:25px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:5"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-XxNYO eWQzGj pf-281_"><div data-pf-type="Image" data-animation="slideInLeft" class="sc-GEbAx gWfVlz pf-282_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0625/6141/9483/t/4/assets/diseo-sin-titulo-34-1651860875538_1200x.png?v=1651860878" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0625/6141/9483/t/4/assets/diseo-sin-titulo-34-1651860875538.png?v=1651860878 1536w" width="800" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="sc-iCfMLu eehqFj pf-283_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-XxNYO eWQzGj pf-284_"><a data-to-section="pf-f8dd" data-offset="{&quot;all&quot;:50,&quot;laptop&quot;:50,&quot;tablet&quot;:50,&quot;mobile&quot;:50}" href="#" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-lcepkR eacNtQ pf-285_ pf-gs-button-3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-287_">➜ Quiero Contratar!</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:7"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-XxNYO eWQzGj pf-288_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hOGkXu NrNIR pf-289_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-291_">Valores publicados sin IVA.&nbsp;</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-hOGkXu NrNIR pf-292_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-gyElHZ fxaypC pf-294_">Despachos</span></h3><p class="sc-FNXRL jGHEAN pf-295_" data-pf-type="Parag